#: ../../source/index.rst:44
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "使用手册"

#: ../../source/index.rst:2
msgid "Project Xent"
msgstr "Project Xent"

#: ../../source/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Project Xent is a native cross-platform UI stack written in C23 "
"(current release **0.3.3**). Application code runs against a platform-"
"neutral control protocol while a native host provides OS windowing, text "
"shaping, input handling, and accessibility."
msgstr ""
"Project Xent 是使用 C23 编写的原生跨平台 UI 技术栈（当前版本 **0.3.3** ）。"
"应用代码面向平台无关的控件协议编写，由底层原生宿主提供操作系统窗口、文本排版、"
"输入处理与无障碍支持。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:10
msgid "Stack Overview"
msgstr "组件栈概览"

#: ../../source/index.rst:12
msgid ""
"Project Xent consists of three C23 packages. Application code works "
"directly with ``xent-kit`` and the target platform host (``fluxent`` on "
"Windows):"
msgstr ""
"Project Xent 由三个 C23 包组成。开发应用程序时，代码直接调用 ``xent-kit`` "
"与目标平台宿主（Windows 上为 ``fluxent`` ）："

#: ../../source/index.rst:19
msgid "Package"
msgstr "包名"

#: ../../source/index.rst:20
msgid "Application Usage"
msgstr "应用层调用方式"

#: ../../source/index.rst:21
msgid "Responsibilities"
msgstr "核心职责"

#: ../../source/index.rst:22
msgid "``xent-core``"
msgstr "``xent-core``"

#: ../../source/index.rst:23
msgid "Pulled automatically as a dependency"
msgstr "作为底层依赖自动拉取"

#: ../../source/index.rst:24
msgid ""
"Platform-neutral layout engine (Flex, Grid, SwiftStack, Absolute), "
"generation-checked node tree, intrinsic and text measurement caches, "
"semantics, and immutable display lists."
msgstr ""
"平台无关的布局引擎（Flex、Grid、SwiftStack、Absolute）、带代次校验的节点树、"
"固有尺寸与文本测量缓存、语义树以及不可变显示列表。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:27
msgid "``xent-kit``"
msgstr "``xent-kit``"

#: ../../source/index.rst:28
msgid "``<xtk/xtk.h>`` or ``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>``"
msgstr "``<xtk/xtk.h>`` 或 ``<xtk/xtk_controls.h>``"

#: ../../source/index.rst:29
msgid ""
"Standard control catalog, atomic ``XtkBatch`` transaction protocol, "
"imperative ``XtkScene`` API, and the declarative ``xtk_*`` runtime."
msgstr ""
"标准控件目录、原子化 ``XtkBatch`` 事务协议、命令式 ``XtkScene`` 接口，"
"以及声明式 ``xtk_*`` 运行时。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:31
msgid "``fluxent``"
msgstr "``fluxent``"

#: ../../source/index.rst:32
msgid "``<fluxent/fluxent.h>``"
msgstr "``<fluxent/fluxent.h>``"

#: ../../source/index.rst:33
msgid ""
"Native Windows 10 1903+ host built on Win32, Direct2D, DirectWrite, "
"DirectComposition, UI Automation, and ``cwinrt``. Manages windows, Fluent"
" control rendering, Mica/Acrylic backdrops, IME, input, and the "
"application event loop (``flux_run`` / ``flux_app_run``)."
msgstr ""
"基于 Win32、Direct2D、DirectWrite、DirectComposition、UI Automation 与 ``cwinrt`` "
"构建的 Windows 10 1903+ 原生宿主，负责窗口管理、Fluent 控件渲染、Mica/Acrylic 背景材质、"
"输入法（IME）、输入分发以及应用主循环（ ``flux_run`` / ``flux_app_run`` ）。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:40
msgid ""
"Official **0.3.3** language bindings share the same control catalog and "
"host: ``oxent`` (Rust), ``zxent`` (Zig), ``xenthon`` (Python 3.12+), and "
"``hsxent`` (Haskell). This manual covers the C23 stack."
msgstr ""
"官方 **0.3.3** 多语言绑定共享同一套控件目录与原生宿主： ``oxent`` （Rust）、"
" ``zxent`` （Zig）、 ``xenthon`` （Python 3.12+）与 ``hsxent`` （Haskell）。"
"本手册介绍 C23 原生技术栈的用法。"
